      <div type="clause" n="2.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IudDeiVIII">Iud Dei VIII</ref> 2.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">þæt, gyf þu ænig ðing ðisse stale wite oððe gewita wære, ðonne gedylegie ðin heorte, ⁊ þis wæter ðe ne underfó;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">if you know anything about this theft or have been an accomplice, then let your heart perish, and let not this water receive you.</ab>
      </div>
